// ES / gold / crude = that market's own test (Dec 2025 – Oct 2026, both periods together, tested exit), points in that market's points
// index: 0–4 X.M4, X.M5, C.M3, C.M4, C.M5 · 5 X.M1 · 6 X.M2 · 7 X.M3 · 8 C.M1 · 9 C.M2 · 10–14 XCS.M1–XCS.M5 · 15 C.M6 · 16 C.M7 · 17 C.M8
